Hermes Agent
https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
Release: v2026.9.7

OpenDuet's runtime image installs Hermes from the release above at build time.
Hermes is not vendored into this repository.

The runtime image and the process supervisor used for local development adapt
the installed Hermes sources through the inherited lifecycle observer bridge,
extended for OpenDuet (packages/runtime-hermes/patches/observer_bridge.py).
The reviewed seams cover run observations, reasoning and media continuity,
brokered tool behavior, and configured output ceilings for agents and auxiliary
compaction. They refuse to apply unless the source hashes match the audited
release. OpenDuet's broker remains responsible for authorization and budgets.
See packages/runtime-hermes/README.md for the current twelve-source audit.

